{'symbol': 'LYB', 'date': '2022-05-27 06:30:00', 'title': 'LYONDELLBASELL ANNOUNCES $5.20 SPECIAL DIVIDEND AND INCREASES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND BY 5 PERCENT', 'text': "HOUSTON AND LONDON , MAY 27, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- LYONDELLBASELL (NYSE: LYB) TODAY ANNOUNCED ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS DECLARED A SPECIAL DIVIDEND OF $5.20 PER SHARE AND A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $1.19 PER SHARE. THE QUARTERLY DIVIDEND REPRESENTS A 5 PERCENT INCREASE OVER THE COMPANY'S FIRST QUARTER 2022 DIVIDEND."}